**/scene_files/*.pbrt
**/scene_files/volumes/
**/scene_files/meshes/*.ply
scene_workspace/.render_runs/
build/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
.venv/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# --- Editor ---
.vscode/settings.json
*.swp
*.swo

# --- OS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Logs ---
render_log.txt
**/scene_files/foliage*.pbrt
**/scene_files/tree*.pbrt
docs/SpaceColonizationAlgorithm_Runion.pdf
docs/runionsa.th2008.pdf
docs/TheAlgorithmicBeautyOfPlants.pdf

